19s looking to get some real coins!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different characters and customization options, it\u2019s up to you to be the witch that suits you the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All witches need cute little cats to guide them through this dark world, make sure to feed them as some have even lower patience than the customers! Looking at you, Lucipurr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/50d6e94f2eaaf86a98110641d6a501b0.avif?t=1754981826\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to wishlist &quot;Witchy Business&quot; on Steam, press the green button by going up the page \ud83d\udc9c</strong></p>",
